        "node_id": "n_3_c83127",
        "thought_text": "The issue lies in how the `jumps` list is being processed. Specifically, the loop that increments elements in the `seq` array should iterate over the range of `N` instead of starting from `0`. This ensures that each element is incremented correctly according to its index modulo the jump value. Additionally, the prefix sum calculation should start from index `0` to avoid off-by-one errors.",
